# Words habitually confused for each other, one group per line.
# Marathi (Devanagari).
# Pairs are 'wrong right'. Sourced from mr.wikipedia AutoWikiBrowser/Typos
# and Wikipedia:शुद्धलेखन चिकित्सा सुधारणा प्रकल्प, expanded from regex rules
# to plain pairs, plus the standing hrasva/dirgha (ि/ी, ु/ू), sibilant
# (श/ष/स), retroflex-nasal (ण/न) and anusvara error classes, and Latin
# transliterations of Marathi names.
